<Weblab2>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:06:34.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# .map() with Objects\r\n\r\n\r\n1.  **Extract Names**\r\n\r\n    Find the `supplyNames` variable. Use `.map()` to create a new array that extracts **only** the `name` from each object.\r\n\r\n2.  **Extension: Combine Fields**\r\n\r\n    Find the `inventoryList` variable. Use `.map()` again to create a new array of strings.\r\n    Combine the name and category for each item using a format like: `\"Notebook - Stationery\"`.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "allowMultipleAttempts": false,
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
        ""
      ],
      "freeResponseHeight": 50,
      "codeEditableAfterSubmit": false
    },
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Mapping Objects</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@300;500&family=Roboto&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <main>\n      <h1>Supply List Mapper</h1>\n\n      <section class=\"panel debug-panel\">\n        <h2>1. Inspect the Data</h2>\n        <p>This is the raw data from your JavaScript file:</p>\n        <pre id=\"originalData\"></pre>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"panel\">\n        <h2>2. Just Names</h2>\n        <ul id=\"nameList\">\n          <li><em>Names will appear here...</em></li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"panel\">\n        <h2>3. Full Inventory (Extension)</h2>\n        <div id=\"inventoryContainer\">\n          <em>Inventory will appear here...</em>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <script src=\"script.js\" defer></script>\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// Sample Dataset\nconst supplies1 = [\n  { name: \"Notebook\", category: \"Stationery\", quantity: 5 },\n  { name: \"Pencil (HB)\", category: \"Writing\", quantity: 12 },\n  { name: \"Eraser\", category: \"Writing\", quantity: 3 },\n  { name: \"Highlighter\", category: \"Stationery\", quantity: 4 }\n];\n\nconst supplyNames = []; \n\n// Visualize the Data (Inspect the Data Panel)\ndocument.querySelector(\"#originalData\").textContent = JSON.stringify(supplies1, null, 2);\n\n// Render Data\nconst nameListElement = document.querySelector(\"#nameList\");\n\nif (supplyNames.length > 0) {\n  const listItems = supplyNames.map(name => `<li>${name}</li>`);\n  nameListElement.innerHTML = listItems.join(\"\");\n}\n\n// --- EXTENSION ---\n\nconst inventoryList = []; \n\n// Render Extension\nconst inventoryContainer = document.querySelector(\"#inventoryContainer\");\n\nif (inventoryList.length > 0) {\n  inventoryContainer.innerHTML = inventoryList.join(\"<br>\");\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": ":root {\n  --bg-color: #f4f7f6;\n  --card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --primary-color: #3d5af1;\n  --text-color: #333333;\n  --debug-bg: #2d2d2d;\n  --debug-text: #00ff9d;\n  --font-heading: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;\n  --font-body: 'Roboto', sans-serif;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  background-color: var(--bg-color);\n  color: var(--text-color);\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\nmain {\n  max-width: 800px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\nh1, h2 {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  color: var(--primary-color);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  text-align: center;\n  margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.panel {\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n}\n\n.debug-panel {\n  border: 2px dashed #ccc;\n}\n\npre {\n  background-color: var(--debug-bg);\n  color: var(--debug-text);\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 0.9em;\n}\n\n#nameList {\n  list-style-type: disc;\n  padding-left: 40px;\n}\n\n#nameList li {\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\n}\n\n#inventoryContainer {\n  background-color: #eef2f5;\n  padding: 15px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-family: monospace;\n  font-size: 1.1em;\n  color: #2c3e50;\n  border-left: 5px solid var(--primary-color);\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "2",
        "1",
        "3"
      ]
    },
